(26, 71, 92, NULL, 'admin_stories/cover_images/ItqVWDLXnCC7OFy33N3Sdq9H9ziyeOzP6FTUyofD.png', 'Death at Fallow End', 'dawn', 'Fantasy', NULL, 'Death at Fallow End - Continued from dawn\'s perspective\n\n\n          \n\nContrary to popular belief, Lorem Ipsum is not simply random text. It has roots in a piece of classical Latin literature from 45 BC, making it over 2000 years old. Richard McClintock, a Latin professo...\n\n\n          \n\n          \n\nAs dawn, I...', 'pending', 'paid', 'cs_test_a1fhFBOBeaiTL3VEXMtsQvhHiJS2Qbq5ofUzm8Tudpz5jOjaooHOZHBXuE', '2025-10-15 17:08:26', '2025-10-15 17:08:26', '2025-10-15 17:08:26');
